		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Lavender-scaled winged serpent. Lairs in attics and haylofts, eating livestock. Ambushes and eats farmers. 12 feet long. Shapechanger.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +4 (2d6 + poison) and 1 constrict (near) or shapechange, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Constrict</strong>. Contested STR to hold target immobile for one round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 DEX damage. Paralyzed at 0 DEX.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the form of a herd animal.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
